EFFICIENT APPROACH -> KMP -> In case of no match we just reset pointer on pattern
LOGIC -> Is the beginning part of the pattern appearing anywhere else in the pattern or not => this way we avoid redundant comparisons
Preffix part = Suffix part in the pattern


LPS => Longest Prefix Sum Array of Pattern
The value in LPS array tells you to which index you need to backtrack(reset) on pattern in case of a mismatch
Doing this we wont need to backtrack on main string s => feeling is that the reset you were previously doing on string as well, felt redundant if you went far and only the last element did not match. 
